{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03F1C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"阔剑地雷是一种定向反步兵地雷。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"杀伤半径约<R=70瓦拉,50m>，会向前方60°散布700颗钢珠。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=70瓦拉,50m>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过，正因为它有方向性，从后方接近就是安全的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"压低身体从后方靠近，就能解除并回收。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"出现图标后，按<I=ACT>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<I=ACT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"回收未使用的阔剑地雷后，也能把它当作自己的武器使用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"另外，也可以从远处开枪把它破坏掉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"当然，如果在近处开枪，自己也会被波及。最好使用狙击步枪之类的武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不过，一旦破坏掉就没法回收了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""}]}